  "content_html": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/97af46b7dd0e9cde82.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/97af46b7dd0e9cde82.jpg\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תעודת רישיון נהיגה 😉(מצרים העתיקה)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">משרד התחבורה או מרכבות פרעה?</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַרְכְּבֹת פַּרְעֹה וְחֵילוֹ יָרָה בַיָּם</span></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-size: large;\"><b>אַחְרָיוּת</b></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> - ששש. סוד צבאי&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👮</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>בִּטּוּחַ סִעוּדִי</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - מקרה סעד&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">♿</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>גִּיּוּס</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - אלו מתים להתגייס, הללו ימותו ולא יתגייסו&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>דֵּמוֹקְרַטְיָה</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - דיקטטורה קצרת מועד&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🗳️</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>הָרָשׁוּת הַלְּאֻמִּית לְ</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - לא משנה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😕</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>וַעֲדַת חֲקִירָה</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - לא ממלכתי&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🆚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>זִמּוּן תּוֹרִים לְמִשְׂרַד הַפְּנִים</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - עינוי אינקVיזיציוני&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>חֹק סִמּוּן מְחִירִים</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - משחק מכור&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎰</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>טוֹבַת הַמְּדִינָה</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - המדינה זה אני&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚬</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>יִהְיֶה גְּהִינוֹם</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - הבטחת בחירות&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🗽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>כִּפַּת בַּרְזֶל</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - הראש היהודי</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>לְכִידוּת</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - ערך חסר...&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🥀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>מֶמְשָׁלָה</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - אשליה אופטית&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🏝️</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>נִצָּחוֹן מֻחְלָט</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - לא סופי&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">⌛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>סִיר הַבָּשָׂר</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - וועדת הכספים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🥩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>עַצְמָאוּת</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - החופש לקבל כל תכתיב&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🆓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>פּוֹעֲלִיצִיָּה</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - משטר קואליציוני&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>צֶבַע אָדֹם</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - תוסף צבע לחיים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>קוֹאָלִיצְיָה</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - פוליגמיה מערבית&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧕</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>רֹאשׁ הַמֶּמְשָׁלָה</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - לא אחראי&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🤷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>שִׁיטַת הַסֶּנְיוֹרִיטִי</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - אני תפסתי ראשון&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>תִּקְשֹׁרֶת אֱמוּנִים</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> - ערוץ 14&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📻</span></p>"
